The SVG files in this folder are the Noto Color Emoji artwork from
https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji tag v2.034 (svg/emoji_uXXXX.svg).
They are bundled so the app shows the same colour glyphs on Android, Windows
and Electron, without a system emoji font.

Each file corresponds to a glyph Voyage Chief or Tank Chief already used on a
button, or to the house, compass and oil-drum marks named with those buttons.
